This directory holds material from the Android Open Source Project, used
only by this repository's tests. Nothing in it is built into the app.

What is here, and where it came from:

  perm_group_location.dart
    The two android:pathData strings of perm_group_location.xml, Android's
    location indicator, unmodified. Source: platform/frameworks/base,
    core/res/res/drawable/perm_group_location.xml, read on the
    android14-release and main branches on 2026-10-04. The same strings are
    in the Android 34 SDK's android.jar and in an API 34 emulator image's
    framework-res.apk. Copyright (C) 2015 The Android Open Source Project.
    The test test/drive_notification_icon_not_location_test.dart draws them
    to check that this app's notification icon is not shaped like them.

